  "description": "Check real-time service status and recent outages from the free, keyless IsItDownStatus (DownStatus) API: look up any monitored service's combined status, list services by category or status, and review outages from the last 7 days. No account or API key required. Disclaimer: this is an independent integration with the community-run IsItDownStatus (isitdownstatus.com); its data is crowdsourced from users and it is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the monitored services.",
  "display_name": "IsItDownStatus",
  "id": "isitdownstatus"
